<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>University & College | Tanzania Student Portal</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background: #f2f6fc;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background: #0756a5;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px 15px;
        }

        nav {
            background: #063b73;
            padding: 14px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 8px;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        section {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .courses {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .course {
            background: #eaf2ff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #063b73;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>University & College Portal</h1>
    <p>Tanzania Student Portal</p>
    <p>Past Papers, Study Materials & College Notices</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
    <a href="#papers">Past Papers</a>
    <a href="#notices">Notices</a>
</nav>

<main>

<section id="courses">
    <h2>Popular Courses</h2>
    <p>Explore learning resources for college and university students.</p>

    <div class="courses">

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Mining & Mineral Processing</h3>
            <p>Mineral Processing, Mining Engineering, Geology and Mine Safety.</p>
            <p>Materials coming soon.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Engineering</h3>
            <p>Civil, Electrical, Mechanical and Chemical Engineering.</p>
            <p>Materials coming soon.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Computer Science & IT</h3>
            <p>Computer Science, Information Technology and Software Development.</p>
            <p>Materials coming soon.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Business & Finance</h3>
            <p>Accounting, Economics, Business Administration and Banking.</p>
            <p>Materials coming soon.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Health Sciences</h3>
            <p>Nursing, Pharmacy, Laboratory Sciences and Public Health.</p>
            <p>Materials coming soon.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Education</h3>
            <p>Teacher Education and Educational Studies.</p>
            <p>Materials coming soon.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Agriculture</h3>
            <p>Agricultural Science, Animal Science and related fields.</p>
            <p>Materials coming soon.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Law & Social Sciences</h3>
            <p>Law, Sociology, Political Science and Social Work.</p>
            <p>Materials coming soon.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="course">
            <h3>Tourism & Hospitality</h3>
            <p>Tourism, Hotel Management and Hospitality.</p>
            <p>Materials coming soon.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section id="papers">
    <h2>University & College Past Papers</h2>
    <p>Past examination papers will be organized by course and institution.</p>
    <p>Past papers coming soon.</p>
</section>

<section id="notices">
    <h2>College & University Notices</h2>
    <p>Important announcements from colleges and universities in Tanzania.</p>

    <ul>
        <li>Examination timetables</li>
        <li>Registration announcements</li>
        <li>Scholarships and internships</li>
        <li>Class timetable changes</li>
        <li>Other official college announcements</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Notice Board:</strong> Official notices will be added here.</p>
</section>

<p><a href="index.html">← Back to Home</a></p>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>Tanzania Student Portal</p>
    <p>Learning Resources and Opportunities for Students</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
